l=3D"noopener">reports from Texas</a>, a Republican state that has become a=
 midterms battleground between Maga and the Democrats, with Elon Musk throw=
n into the mix for extra spice. Danny Fortson <a href=3D"https://link.theti=
mes.com/click/48195649.498247/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3VzL2FtZXJpY=
