 style=3D"text-decoration: underline; color: #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">is =
in California</a> where, despite record-high petrol prices and widespread d=
iscontent, the Democrats are predicted to hold on. How do they keep winning=
 in what was once the Republican-friendly state of Reagan and Schwarzenegge=
r? In Israel, the election is over but the horse-trading has only just begu=
