><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">Both elections may=
 affect the cost of living, particularly if Israel and the US renew hostili=
ties against Iran. Andy Burnham has ruled out an election for the next 12 m=
onths, so after what has widely been seen as a relatively inconsequential b=
udget, what is he planning to do with his next year in charge? Our politica=
