b9cB8cbafe54" target=3D"_blank" style=3D"text-decoration: underline; color:=
 #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">much is riding on the prime minister=E2=80=99s =
ten-year plan</a>, due before Christmas. Rachel Reeves, meanwhile, <a href=
=3D"https://link.thetimes.com/click/48195649.498247/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGl=
